ansforms into a mighty robot — the Shinkalion E5 Hayabusa.\n\nIn the anime's story, Hayato and other children will serve as conductors to pilot the Shinkalion. The children must work together with the adults of the \"Shinkansen Ultra Evolution Institute\" (SUEI) to defeat a monster that looks like a jet black bullet train.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Trains","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Robot","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vocal Synth","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crossover","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Educational","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Shinkansen Henkei Robo Shinkalion THE ANIMATION","english":null,"native":"新幹線変形ロボ シンカリオン THE ANIMATION","romaji":"Shinkansen Henkei Robo Shinkalion THE ANIMATION","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"新幹線変形ロボ シンカリオン"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"新干线变形机器人"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"新干线战士"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"新干线变形机器人 Shinkalion"}]},"trailer":{"id":"bDT5UZvQmoY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bDT5UZvQmoY/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}